558
00:19:00,985 --> 00:19:02,555
This makes me happy.

559
00:19:02,555 --> 00:19:04,595
The meat even sizzles.

560
00:19:04,595 --> 00:19:05,825
My goodness.

561
00:19:05,825 --> 00:19:08,295
- My goodness, for sure. - The meat is cooking.

562
00:19:08,295 --> 00:19:09,365
