569
00:19:21,775 --> 00:19:22,875
My gosh.

570
00:19:23,575 --> 00:19:25,145
(Laughing)

571
00:19:25,145 --> 00:19:26,845
(Laughing)

572
00:19:26,845 --> 00:19:28,185
