580
00:19:40,695 --> 00:19:42,695
It's good-quality beef.

581
00:19:43,195 --> 00:19:44,195
Strip loin.

582
00:19:44,195 --> 00:19:45,195
(Thinking)

583
00:19:45,195 --> 00:19:46,295
Even a baby...

584
00:19:46,595 --> 00:19:48,705
