585
00:19:48,705 --> 00:19:49,765
Absolutely.

586
00:19:49,765 --> 00:19:51,575
You're unhappy about it, aren't you?

587
00:19:52,275 --> 00:19:54,145
- He's getting irritated. - About the restaurant.

588
00:19:54,145 --> 00:19:56,405
The food is so small it's already stuck between my teeth.

589
00:19:56,405 --> 00:19:57,715
(The food is already stuck between my teeth!)

590
00:19:57,715 --> 00:19:58,715
The food is stuck between my teeth.

591
00:20:00,315 --> 00:20:01,315
