592
00:20:01,315 --> 00:20:02,515
I've already finished my food.

593
00:20:02,515 --> 00:20:03,515
(I'm eating mine all in one bite!)

594
00:20:03,515 --> 00:20:04,555
- Really. - She picked them...

595
00:20:04,555 --> 00:20:05,585
