598
00:20:09,525 --> 00:20:10,625
My gosh.

599
00:20:11,455 --> 00:20:13,095
It feels like I had a proper piece of beef.

600
00:20:13,695 --> 00:20:16,395
(Meanwhile, Kyoung Pyo is lost in thought.)

601
00:20:17,265 --> 00:20:18,795
(The ssam goes in one bite.)

602
00:20:21,665 --> 00:20:23,505
(The seasoned radish goes in one bite.)

603
00:20:23,835 --> 00:20:25,905
(The fresh kimchi goes in one bite.)

604
00:20:27,005 --> 00:20:29,445
(The beef goes in one bite.)

605
00:20:29,505 --> 00:20:32,475
(Empty)

606
00:20:33,345 --> 00:20:36,345
(Done in 10 seconds, and he's barely taken the edge off his appetite.)

607
00:20:36,345 --> 00:20:38,515
It's a shame the portions are so small.

608
00:20:38,515 --> 00:20:40,215
(Delicious, but the portions are tiny. Is this place be real?)

609
00:20:40,215 --> 00:20:42,755
