623
00:21:14,685 --> 00:21:15,855
It's actually good.

624
00:21:16,155 --> 00:21:17,395
My gosh.

625
00:21:17,425 --> 00:21:18,425
(This one)

626
00:21:18,425 --> 00:21:20,025
- The soy sauce is really good. - It's delicious.

627
00:21:20,025 --> 00:21:21,195
It's great with the sanjeok.

628
00:21:21,195 --> 00:21:23,195
(Seasoned soy sauce pairs perfectly with the jeon.)

629
00:21:23,925 --> 00:21:26,865
(A hungry Kyoung Pyo takes a bite of kimchi jeon.)

630
00:21:26,865 --> 00:21:28,265
It's actually delicious.

631
00:21:28,265 --> 00:21:29,535
You should've made it bigger.

632
00:21:31,205 --> 00:21:33,135
- My gosh. - It's delicious.

633
00:21:33,135 --> 00:21:34,245
It's really good.

634
00:21:34,405 --> 00:21:36,675
