635
00:21:36,675 --> 00:21:38,615
There he goes, hosting his own show again.

636
00:21:38,645 --> 00:21:39,675
(Kyeong Hwan's kimchi jeon eating show)

637
00:21:39,675 --> 00:21:40,715
This right here is kimchi jeon.

638
00:21:40,715 --> 00:21:42,585
(- It looks good! - That's tiny! Cute!)

639
00:21:42,685 --> 00:21:44,255
On "Hangout with Yoo," we keep a separate recording of...

640
00:21:44,255 --> 00:21:45,815
Kyeong Hwan talking to himself.

641
00:21:46,615 --> 00:21:47,825
- It's good. - I've seen...

642
00:21:47,825 --> 00:21:49,555
- places on this show... - Yes?

643
00:21:49,555 --> 00:21:52,255
that looked totally fake but turned out to be real.

644
00:21:52,255 --> 00:21:53,525
- Yes. - Totally.

645
00:21:53,895 --> 00:21:55,695
I could see paying...

646
00:21:55,695 --> 00:21:58,295
seventy-nine dollars for the course...

647
00:21:58,295 --> 00:22:00,665
