648
00:22:00,665 --> 00:22:01,805
If not...

649
00:22:01,805 --> 00:22:03,205
The price.

650
00:22:03,435 --> 00:22:04,735
I'm having doubts.

651
00:22:05,035 --> 00:22:06,835
But why 79 dollars?

652
00:22:06,835 --> 00:22:08,305
Could it be...

653
00:22:08,305 --> 00:22:09,475
Seven and nine. What a pair.

654
00:22:09,475 --> 00:22:10,575
- Wait. - Seven and nine. What a pair.

655
00:22:11,115 --> 00:22:12,575
That could be a hint.

656
00:22:12,575 --> 00:22:14,115
- Hint. - Totally.

657
00:22:14,515 --> 00:22:17,955
(The price could be a hint?)

658
00:22:17,955 --> 00:22:19,315
- It's good. - It could totally be a hint.

659
00:22:19,785 --> 00:22:20,855
Can you even focus on the clues?

660
00:22:20,855 --> 00:22:21,855
(No interest in playing detective)

661
00:22:21,855 --> 00:22:22,925
It's really good.

662
00:22:23,185 --> 00:22:24,925
- Try the sanjeok. - It's obvious, isn't it?

663
00:22:24,925 --> 00:22:26,725
- If it's 79 dollars... - Try the sanjeok.

664
00:22:26,725 --> 00:22:27,725
(Dumbfounded)

665
00:22:27,725 --> 00:22:29,125
- What kind of show is this? - Hey.

666
00:22:29,125 --> 00:22:30,265
This isn't just an eating show.

667
00:22:30,265 --> 00:22:31,695
It's really good. Try it, Eun I.

668
00:22:31,795 --> 00:22:33,195
It tastes like regular sanjeok.

669
00:22:33,195 --> 00:22:34,565
The sanjeok is amazing.

670
00:22:34,565 --> 00:22:35,735
(It is good!)

671
00:22:36,235 --> 00:22:39,975
(This place is real! It tastes too good to be fake!)

672
00:22:41,845 --> 00:22:43,405
The address is 79-gil.

673
00:22:43,405 --> 00:22:44,775
(The address is Gangnamdae-ro 79-gil.)

674
00:22:44,845 --> 00:22:45,875
- You're right. - What?

675
00:22:46,515 --> 00:22:48,185
- The address? - It's 79-gil.

676
00:22:48,185 --> 00:22:49,985
This place is on Gangnamdae-ro 79-gil.

677
00:22:49,985 --> 00:22:52,885
- For real? - Yes, it's 79-gil.

678
00:22:52,885 --> 00:22:56,125
Really? And it costs 79 dollars? That can't be a coincidence.

679
00:22:56,125 --> 00:22:57,125
(79-gil and 79 dollars)

680
00:22:57,455 --> 00:22:58,995
- What do you think? - It's a B-Side.

681
00:22:58,995 --> 00:23:00,025
You're shocked, aren't you?

682
00:23:01,425 --> 00:23:04,765
(Here's your punishment!)

683
00:23:05,995 --> 00:23:07,265
(Emergency evacuation)

684
00:23:07,265 --> 00:23:09,235
- What's wrong? - Someone bit me.

685
00:23:09,605 --> 00:23:10,735
What happened?

686
00:23:10,735 --> 00:23:12,575
Is there a dog in here? Something bit me.

687
00:23:12,575 --> 00:23:14,605
- Maybe there's a bee in here. - What is it?

688
00:23:14,645 --> 00:23:15,705
I...

689
00:23:15,705 --> 00:23:18,045
He was getting on my nerves.

690
00:23:18,615 --> 00:23:20,545
The rice is done. It's cauldron-cooked rice.

691
00:23:21,915 --> 00:23:23,115
It's pot rice.

692
00:23:23,115 --> 00:23:24,115
(Meanwhile, the final course is coming together.)

693
00:23:24,385 --> 00:23:27,785
You could make sushi out of that rice.

694
00:23:28,425 --> 00:23:29,525
Do you cook everything...

695
00:23:29,525 --> 00:23:30,585
