698
00:23:35,125 --> 00:23:37,265
This place is real. I'm telling you, it's real.

699
00:23:37,265 --> 00:23:38,735
- Remember what I said? - I think it's real.

700
00:23:38,965 --> 00:23:40,795
Everything she says adds up.

701
00:23:41,105 --> 00:23:43,535
- Even the high price. - True.

702
00:23:43,965 --> 00:23:45,875
- My gosh, it's marinated crab. - Is that marinated crab?

703
00:23:45,875 --> 00:23:48,205
- Oh, my. Sentinel crab. - Isn't that sentinel crab?

704
00:23:48,205 --> 00:23:49,305
That's right. You know your crabs.

705
00:23:49,305 --> 00:23:51,775
They're the smallest sentinel crabs.

706
00:23:51,775 --> 00:23:54,285
(Adorable mini soy sauce marinated crab)

707
00:23:54,285 --> 00:23:56,285
It's gorgeous!

708
00:23:57,185 --> 00:24:00,555
This course is a spread of warm, comforting home cooking.

709
00:24:00,555 --> 00:24:01,555
(The home-cooked meal course)

710
00:24:01,785 --> 00:24:03,855
I put the rice in a mini cauldron...

711
00:24:04,395 --> 00:24:06,555
and let it cook.

712
00:24:07,695 --> 00:24:11,435
For the seaweed soup, I saute the beef and seaweed,

713
00:24:12,665 --> 00:24:14,565
then add water and let it simmer.

714
00:24:14,565 --> 00:24:15,905
(Once it's simmered, the soup is ready.)

715
00:24:15,905 --> 00:24:18,675
In the meantime, I prep the mini vegetables...

716
00:24:19,905 --> 00:24:22,105
