717
00:24:23,005 --> 00:24:25,045
I roll the omelet up neatly.

718
00:24:27,345 --> 00:24:28,515
For the soy sauce marinated crab,

719
00:24:28,515 --> 00:24:30,845
I carefully select Korean sentinel crabs.

720
00:24:31,055 --> 00:24:34,355
They're tiny, but they're perfect when mixed with rice.

721
00:24:35,285 --> 00:24:37,355
