724
00:24:41,565 --> 00:24:43,865
My gosh, you really prepared a feast for us.

725
00:24:45,665 --> 00:24:46,665
You're being sarcastic.

726
00:24:46,665 --> 00:24:49,335
You keep saying this is real, so stop being so sarcastic.

727
00:24:49,335 --> 00:24:50,705
I wasn't being sarcastic.

728
00:24:50,705 --> 00:24:52,335
I'll have to use the spoon like a fork.

729
00:24:53,205 --> 00:24:54,475
(Empties the bowl in seconds)

730
00:24:54,605 --> 00:24:55,905
The eggs.

731
00:24:57,815 --> 00:24:58,945
