732
00:24:58,945 --> 00:25:00,615
How's the rolled omelet?

733
00:25:00,915 --> 00:25:02,385
It's good, and I mean the rolled omelet.

734
00:25:02,385 --> 00:25:03,385
(Tiny in size, big on flavor)

735
00:25:03,585 --> 00:25:06,655
(They down it in one bite at the same time.)

736
00:25:06,655 --> 00:25:07,655
(Amazed)

737
00:25:07,655 --> 00:25:09,485
- The seaweed soup is good. - There's no rice for me.

738
00:25:09,625 --> 00:25:12,325
- Does it taste like seaweed soup? - It does.

739
00:25:12,555 --> 00:25:14,395
Seriously, why is this perilla leaf so good?

740
00:25:14,395 --> 00:25:16,425
- The perilla leaf is good. - It's delicious.

741
00:25:16,595 --> 00:25:18,465
The owner doesn't just throw this stuff together.

742
00:25:18,465 --> 00:25:20,395
- She's actually a good cook. - Exactly.

743
00:25:20,935 --> 00:25:22,705
- I'm getting sucked into this. - The marinated crab.

744
00:25:22,705 --> 00:25:23,865
I'm curious about it.

745
00:25:24,535 --> 00:25:26,575
Here goes my bite.

746
00:25:26,775 --> 00:25:27,805
(Kyeong Hwan's mini-kase eating show)

747
00:25:27,805 --> 00:25:28,945
Like so.

748
00:25:28,945 --> 00:25:31,215
