749
00:25:31,215 --> 00:25:34,445
Kyeong Hwan, could you stop talking to yourself? You're talking over us.

750
00:25:35,015 --> 00:25:36,445
You can stop talking when I talk.

751
00:25:36,445 --> 00:25:38,285
(Sulking)

752
00:25:38,485 --> 00:25:40,415
(You're right!)

753
00:25:40,415 --> 00:25:41,785
Who cares if our voices overlap?

754
00:25:42,455 --> 00:25:43,585
- True. - Are you picking on me...

755
00:25:43,585 --> 00:25:44,695
