756
00:25:45,825 --> 00:25:47,025
Kyoung Pyo is being mean.

757
00:25:47,025 --> 00:25:48,895
- Yes, I am. - Kyeong Hwan, get over it.

758
00:25:49,425 --> 00:25:51,565
Listen. I've mentioned earlier.

759
00:25:53,035 --> 00:25:55,265
What the owner said adds up.

760
00:25:55,265 --> 00:25:57,735
- It was scripted. - My goodness.

761
00:25:57,735 --> 00:25:58,775
(It was scripted.)

762
00:25:59,105 --> 00:26:00,675
