763
00:26:00,675 --> 00:26:02,405
"Sixth Sense" doesn't make you any sharper.

764
00:26:02,975 --> 00:26:04,975
(Kyoung Pyo agrees.)

765
00:26:04,975 --> 00:26:06,615
Jae Seok only got more irritable.

766
00:26:06,615 --> 00:26:09,845
