772
00:26:20,025 --> 00:26:21,225
No, I don't need to compare places.

773
00:26:21,225 --> 00:26:22,425
- How come? - I'm certain.

774
00:26:22,425 --> 00:26:23,695
Go home.

775
00:26:24,225 --> 00:26:25,395
What are you here for?

776
00:26:25,535 --> 00:26:27,295
(Woo Jae, go home.)

777
00:26:27,295 --> 00:26:28,465
(Sulking)

778
00:26:28,465 --> 00:26:30,265
Eun I, call his manager over.

779
00:26:30,265 --> 00:26:31,705
(Call his manager over now.)

780
00:26:31,705 --> 00:26:33,335
Take your car home.

781
00:26:33,335 --> 00:26:34,675
Okay, I'm the only guest now.

782
00:26:35,445 --> 00:26:36,745
(Yes!)

783
00:26:37,675 --> 00:26:39,515
- I'm fine. - He comes on the show...

784
00:26:39,515 --> 00:26:41,785
- I can choose not to leave. - He's not helpful.

785
00:26:42,015 --> 00:26:44,245
