1116
00:38:10,504 --> 00:38:12,374
Exactly. Gosh, Kyeong Hwan.

1117
00:38:12,374 --> 00:38:13,774
- That's exactly it. - I thought that too.

1118
00:38:13,774 --> 00:38:14,774
Right.

1119
00:38:14,774 --> 00:38:16,714
(The beef bone soup restaurant doesn't smell like one...)

1120
00:38:16,714 --> 00:38:18,484
