1132
00:38:42,734 --> 00:38:44,104
It's just the way I like it.

1133
00:38:44,134 --> 00:38:45,544
(Sniffing)

1134
00:38:45,544 --> 00:38:47,574
- It's like Pyeongyang naengmyeon. - Come.

1135
00:38:47,974 --> 00:38:49,044
- Come. - Come.

1136
00:38:49,044 --> 00:38:50,174
