1144
00:39:10,764 --> 00:39:13,404
So a lot of people like it.

1145
00:39:13,404 --> 00:39:15,334
(Everyone loves the clear and strong meat-tasting broth.)

1146
00:39:15,504 --> 00:39:17,504
And the one in the middle is suyuk.

1147
00:39:17,504 --> 00:39:20,404
It comprises various parts of beef brisket...

1148
00:39:20,404 --> 00:39:21,504
