1149
00:39:22,274 --> 00:39:25,314
Under the meat is pickled shallot.

1150
00:39:25,584 --> 00:39:27,214
It has truffle scent added.

1151
00:39:28,984 --> 00:39:32,524
(The fourth beef bone soup course: Cheongmyeon featuring suyuk)

1152
00:39:32,524 --> 00:39:33,584
Enjoy.

1153
00:39:36,394 --> 00:39:37,454
(Amazed)

1154
00:39:38,864 --> 00:39:40,764
The soup.

1155
00:39:41,124 --> 00:39:43,494
- Is it amazing? - Hey.

1156
00:39:43,734 --> 00:39:44,834
- This is it. - Is the soup amazing?

1157
00:39:44,834 --> 00:39:45,834
Seriously.

1158
00:39:45,834 --> 00:39:47,834
(Slurping noodles)

1159
00:39:47,834 --> 00:39:50,434
