1167
00:40:04,414 --> 00:40:05,454
(Slurping)

1168
00:40:06,454 --> 00:40:07,924
The broth is incredible.

1169
00:40:07,924 --> 00:40:09,354
- Yes, the broth. - It's so delicious.

1170
00:40:09,354 --> 00:40:11,324
(The broth is amazing.)

1171
00:40:11,524 --> 00:40:14,464
How is the broth so clear?

1172
00:40:14,464 --> 00:40:18,804
(The beef bone soup's zest from the broth boiled for 10 hours)

1173
00:40:19,304 --> 00:40:20,364
Suyuk.

1174
00:40:20,364 --> 00:40:24,104
(Still slurping noodles)

1175
00:40:25,344 --> 00:40:26,874
Suyuk is so delicious.

1176
00:40:27,644 --> 00:40:28,844
It's so good.

1177
00:40:30,574 --> 00:40:33,084
(She's moved by its taste.)

1178
00:40:33,084 --> 00:40:34,344
It's so good.

1179
00:40:35,584 --> 00:40:37,614
