1185
00:40:48,734 --> 00:40:50,064
- "Su." - "Su."

1186
00:40:50,994 --> 00:40:52,004
- Suyuk. - It's so good.

1187
00:40:52,004 --> 00:40:53,004
Suyuk. "Yuk."

1188
00:40:53,004 --> 00:40:54,134
It's meat.

1189
00:40:54,504 --> 00:40:56,974
(The main producer is disappointed.)

1190
00:40:56,974 --> 00:40:59,304
Hold on, someone just made a disappointed sound.

1191
00:40:59,374 --> 00:41:01,704
Don't mind it.

1192
00:41:01,704 --> 00:41:03,944
I'll only be able to come back in the next season again.

1193
00:41:04,914 --> 00:41:06,314
Isn't the next season too soon?

1194
00:41:07,414 --> 00:41:08,544
At this point...

1195
00:41:09,254 --> 00:41:10,854
