1196
00:41:11,954 --> 00:41:14,454
(Regardless, it's delicious, so eat up.)

1197
00:41:14,454 --> 00:41:17,394
We have to think carefully.

1198
00:41:17,554 --> 00:41:19,824
Maybe they mixed dongchimi broth and meat broth...

1199
00:41:19,824 --> 00:41:20,964
