1200
00:41:20,964 --> 00:41:22,994
Store-bought broths are pretty good nowadays.

1201
00:41:22,994 --> 00:41:23,994
No way.

1202
00:41:23,994 --> 00:41:26,004
They could make this if they mixed the right ratio.

1203
00:41:26,504 --> 00:41:28,634
We never got to see...

1204
00:41:28,634 --> 00:41:30,574
