1205
00:41:30,734 --> 00:41:32,504
- When you boil beef bone soup, - Yes.

1206
00:41:32,504 --> 00:41:34,144
- it's white. - Yes.

1207
00:41:34,144 --> 00:41:36,144
How is cheongtang so clear?

1208
00:41:36,144 --> 00:41:37,874
You must be familiar with...

1209
00:41:37,874 --> 00:41:40,184
