1210
00:41:40,184 --> 00:41:41,244
Yes.

1211
00:41:41,244 --> 00:41:42,484
(White beef bone soup made by boiling bones)

1212
00:41:42,484 --> 00:41:45,984
Cheongtang is clear broth boiled using beef brisket meat.

1213
00:41:45,984 --> 00:41:49,094
(Clear cheongtang is boiled only using the meat.)

1214
00:41:49,324 --> 00:41:50,754
You can feel the thickness, right?

1215
00:41:50,754 --> 00:41:52,294
- It's like... - You pass.

1216
00:41:52,664 --> 00:41:54,794
