1221
00:42:00,764 --> 00:42:02,004
(Emotional BIBI cannot understand.)

1222
00:42:02,274 --> 00:42:04,174
(BIBI dissing him makes her happy.)

1223
00:42:04,174 --> 00:42:06,604
There are moments when he gives you the ick.

1224
00:42:07,144 --> 00:42:09,544
That's why he always talks with the production crew.

1225
00:42:09,544 --> 00:42:11,574
He knows what he's doing...

1226
00:42:11,974 --> 00:42:13,084
