1235
00:42:31,334 --> 00:42:34,204
On the fourth day, we combine all the broth and boil it down.

1236
00:42:34,204 --> 00:42:35,834
(Broth boiled for 10 hours, 20 hours, and 30 hours each)

1237
00:42:36,334 --> 00:42:38,274
We call it "haptang."

1238
00:42:38,274 --> 00:42:42,374
(The final beef bone soup course: Haptang boiled for 40 hours)

1239
00:42:42,544 --> 00:42:45,014
And I served some kimchi with it.

1240
00:42:45,274 --> 00:42:46,544
It's not ordinary kimchi.

1241
00:42:46,544 --> 00:42:49,084
To show our unique kimchi,

1242
