1243
00:42:50,754 --> 00:42:52,284
(Tomato kimchi, Korean mint kimchi, Korean melon kimchi,)

1244
00:42:52,284 --> 00:42:53,684
(pickled shepherd's purse, kohlrabi kimchi)

1245
00:42:53,724 --> 00:42:54,724
(Sniffing for the umpteenth time)

1246
00:42:55,324 --> 00:42:58,524
You know how beef bone soup has that dog foot smell?

1247
00:42:58,594 --> 00:43:00,594
- What? The savory smell? - That tonkotsu smell.

1248
00:43:01,024 --> 00:43:02,064
The savory smell.

1249
00:43:02,264 --> 00:43:04,394
- It smells like tonkotsu. - Right, the tonkotsu smell.

1250
00:43:04,534 --> 00:43:05,964
From boiling the bone many times.

1251
00:43:06,104 --> 00:43:07,104
Isn't it tonkotsu?

1252
00:43:07,164 --> 00:43:08,234
(Amazed)

1253
00:43:09,604 --> 00:43:10,804
I love it.

1254
00:43:10,804 --> 00:43:12,104
