1255
00:43:12,104 --> 00:43:13,944
It's so delicious.

1256
00:43:14,044 --> 00:43:15,974
This is rich.

1257
00:43:16,544 --> 00:43:17,574
It's so rich.

1258
00:43:17,574 --> 00:43:18,674
(Haptang has become very rich from boiling for 40 hours.)

1259
00:43:18,714 --> 00:43:21,714
- It's so delicious. - This is rich.

1260
00:43:21,714 --> 00:43:24,514
(Nodding)

1261
00:43:25,114 --> 00:43:27,524
If this is a fake place made by the production crew,

1262
