1269
00:43:41,564 --> 00:43:42,774
(Falling)

1270
00:43:42,774 --> 00:43:43,904
It survived.

1271
00:43:44,634 --> 00:43:45,704
Because it's fresh.

1272
00:43:45,704 --> 00:43:46,804
