1277
00:43:56,184 --> 00:43:57,214
I might not make it in the next season.

1278
00:43:57,214 --> 00:43:59,184
The food itself is amazing.

1279
00:43:59,284 --> 00:44:01,154
But beef bone soup is a dish...

1280
00:44:01,154 --> 00:44:03,054
